{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6327","title":"Xiaomi Introduces REDMI 17 Series with a 7,500mAh Battery, Expansive 6.9-inch Display, and Everyday Durability","desc":"Xiaomi today introduced REDMI 17 Series, the latest generation of its value-focused smartphone lineup, with REDMI 17 and REDMI 17 5G.","view_cnt":"5076","like_cnt":"2","add_time":"1785497473","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/612_operatorx_operatorx_opx/31/07/2026/59795f29a600c06db9a6945216870954.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBEIJING, China, August 7, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e – Xiaomi today introduced REDMI 17 Series, the latest generation of its value-focused smartphone lineup, built for all-day reliability and effortless entertainment to more users around the world. Featuring REDMI 17 and REDMI 17 5G, the series pairs a massive 7,500mAh (typ) battery with a 6.9-inch² immersive high-refresh-rate display and a 50MP AI dual camera system, delivering a durable and reliable smartphone experience built to keep pace with everyday life.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/929_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/08/2026/2444720bfe948a6270bf50b904271c1d.jpg\" alt=\"Two models of the REDMI 17 series smartphones are displayed side by side, with the left featuring an orange leather appearance and the right showcasing a green plant texture, both labeled with a 50MP camera. The adjacent text emphasizes \u0026quot;super large battery, long-lasting endurance,\u0026quot; highlighting the 7500mAh battery capacity.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLarger battery and faster charging for everyday reliability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePower is at the core of REDMI 17 Series. Built around a massive 7500mAh (typ) battery, the series is engineered to stay productive, entertained, and connected for longer, helping users go longer between charges.¹ Whether streaming, navigating, video calling, or creating content, the large-capacity battery is designed to keep up with busy schedules and longer days.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether watching videos, listening to music, staying connected, or capturing everyday moments, REDMI 17 Series is designed to keep up with the demands of everyday life. Depending on the activity, REDMI 17 delivers up to 28 hours of video playback, 91 hours of music playback, 46 hours of calling, or 12 hours of video recording, while REDMI 17 5G supports up to 28 hours of 1080p local video playback, 109 hours of music playback with Bluetooth® earphones, 53 hours of calling, or 10 hours of 1080p video recording.²\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/360_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/08/2026/3159d2067e0caf5f3097ed7084e51449.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith 45W turbo charging,³ REDMI 17 Series gets back to full power in just 96 minutes, while a quick 35-minute charge is enough to power through the day.¹ It also supports 22.5W wired reverse charging that adds even greater convenience, allowing REDMI 17 Series to power compatible accessories whenever they're needed.⁴\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAn expansive display for immersive viewing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI 17 Series features an expansive 6.9-inch immersive display that brings a more immersive viewing experience across streaming, gaming, browsing, and reading. Its intelligent 120Hz AdaptiveSync refresh rate dynamically adjusts between 60Hz, 90Hz, and 120Hz to keep interactions smooth while optimizing power efficiency.⁵ Combined with Triple TÜV Rheinland certifications and DC dimming, the display provides a more comfortable viewing experience, even during extended use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt to withstand the demands of everyday life, the display is protected by Corning® Gorilla® Glass 7i for enhanced scratch resistance and improved drop protection. IP64 dust and water resistance together with Wet Touch Technology help ensure reliable responsiveness across a variety of everyday conditions.⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/104_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/08/2026/1523610b5a07174699a58d9ab22dba17.jpg\" alt=\"A hand is holding a smartphone, and the phone's screen displays a gradient pattern against a pure white background.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBold new design, inside and out\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI 17 Series introduces an all-new, nature-inspired design language in a range of classic and expressive colors that balances clean aesthetics with everyday practicality. Available in a selection of carefully curated finishes, REDMI 17 comes in Black, Deep Blue, Oak Green, and Lotus Purple, while REDMI 17 5G is offered in Black, Deep Blue, and Vivid Orange,⁷ with the latter featuring a premium PU leather finish for a softer, more comfortable grip.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBeyond its refreshed color palette, REDMI's flat display and matte frame architecture as well as Metal Deco design come together with a more pronounced R-angle to create a flagship-inspired look that's as comfortable to hold as it is to look at, while a center punch-hole display and thinner bezels give the front a cleaner, more immersive appearance. Rounding out the design is a Dynamic RGB Light system that brings personalized lighting to incoming calls, app notifications, charging status, gaming, and camera use, combining practical feedback with distinctive visual expression.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/532_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/08/2026/38a5edd5828d2b57c8605ccfa9a32967.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmooth performance for everyday entertainment\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI 17 Series combines capable hardware with Xiaomi HyperOS 3 to deliver a smooth and responsive experience across everyday tasks, entertainment, and multitasking.⁹ REDMI 17 is powered by the MediaTek Helio G91-Ultra, while REDMI 17 5G features the Snapdragon® 4 Gen 5 Mobile Platform with 5G for faster, more reliable connectivity. Both models support up to 12GB of RAM with Memory Extension,⁸ helping apps launch faster and multitasking feel more responsive. Xiaomi HyperOS 3 further enhances the experience with smoother animations,⁹ improved responsiveness, and more seamless day-to-day interactions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor the camera, REDMI 17 Series' 50MP AI dual camera system captures stunningly clear, natural images in everyday environments, while front and rear dual-view shooting makes it easy to record moments from multiple perspectives all at once. For those live-out-loud moments, dual stereo speakers equipped with up to 300% volume boost bring bigger,¹⁰ more powerful audio to videos, music, calls, and more.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/942_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/08/2026/2c993c92874f22048d3e649b9b99a497.jpg\" alt=\"A young woman is sitting on the sofa, smiling at her phone. She is wearing an orange T-shirt with lace sleeves, and the surrounding environment is comfortable, featuring a sofa and a coffee table, with fruit placed on the table.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI 17 will be available in four colors: Black, Deep Blue, Oak Green, and Lotus Purple.⁷\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt will be available in four variants: 4GB+128GB, 4GB+256GB, 6GB+128GB, and 6GB+256GB,¹⁴ starting from USD 179.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI 17 5G will be available in three colors: Black, Deep Blue, and Vivid Orange.⁷\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt will be available in three variants: 4GB+128GB, 4GB+256GB, and 6GB+256GB,¹⁴ starting from USD 249.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct images are available to download through the links below:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgA0ikiiYuDtSoYw3R9lS2B6AZnZvQb8PVVnKdWCNmB_ySk?e=sjT37z\"\u003eREDMI 17\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgCVwGXJnQxDTqIJ6tuLXFgIAVWFZQuGXW7LM4ZMpiVGswE?e=SyH7lv\"\u003eREDMI 17 5G\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eREDMI 17 and REDMI 17 5G Quick Specs\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable style=\"min-width: 75px;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol style=\"min-width: 25px;\"\u003e\u003ccol style=\"min-width: 25px;\"\u003e\u003ccol style=\"min-width: 25px;\"\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eREDMI 17\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eREDMI 17 5G\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDesign\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFlat display and matte frame architecture with Metal Deco design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 170.12mm x 78.42mm x 8.8mm²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWeight: 232g²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eColors: Black, Deep Blue, Oak Green, Lotus Purple⁷\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIP64 dust and water resistance⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFlat display and matte frame architecture with Metal Deco design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 170.12mm x 78.42mm x 8.8mm²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWeight: 232g²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eColors: Black, Deep Blue, Vivid Orange⁷\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eVivid Orange with PU Leather Texture\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIP64 dust and water resistance⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCamera\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e50MP main camera\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e5P lens, f/1.8\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAuxiliary lens\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e8MP front camera\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ef/2.05\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e50MP main camera\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e5P lens, f/1.8\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAuxiliary lens\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e8MP front camera\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ef/2.05\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e6.9\" display²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResolution: 1600 x 720\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRefresh rate: Up to 120Hz⁵\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBrightness: 675 nits (typ), 825 nits HBM\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTÜV Rheinland Low Blue Light (Software Solution)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTÜV Rheinland Circadian Friendly\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTÜV Rheinland Flicker Free\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDC dimming\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTouch sampling rate: Up to 240Hz\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContrast ratio: 1400:1\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eColor depth: 8-bit, 16.7 million colors\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eColor gamut: 83% NTSC\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e6.9\" display²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResolution: 1600 x 720\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRefresh rate: Up to 120Hz⁵\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBrightness: 675 nits (typ), 825 nits HBM\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTÜV Rheinland Low Blue Light (Software Solution)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTÜV Rheinland Circadian Friendly\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTÜV Rheinland Flicker Free\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDC dimming\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTouch sampling rate: Up to 240Hz\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContrast ratio: 1400:1\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eColor depth: 8-bit, 16.7 million colors\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eColor gamut: 83% NTSC\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerformance\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMediaTek Helio G91-Ultra\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e12nm process, octa-core\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCPU: Cortex-A75 + Cortex-A55\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMax CPU frequency: 2.0GHz\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGPU: Mali-G52 MC2™\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupports up to 12GB RAM with Memory extension⁸\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupports up to 2TB expandable storage¹¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi HyperOS 3⁹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSnapdragon® 4 Gen 5 Mobile Platform\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e4nm process, octa-core\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCPU: Cortex-A78 + Cortex-A55\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMax CPU frequency: 2.4GHz\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGPU: Qualcomm® Adreno™\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupports up to 12GB RAM with Memory extension⁸\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupports up to 2TB expandable storage¹¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi HyperOS 3⁹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e7,500mAh (typ) battery\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e45W turbo charging³\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e22.5W wired reverse-charging⁴\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUSB Type-C\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e7,500mAh (typ) battery\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e45W turbo charging³\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e22.5W wired reverse-charging⁴\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUSB Type-C\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDual stereo speakers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUp to 300% volume boost¹⁰\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e3.5mm headphone jack\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDual stereo speakers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUp to 300% volume boost¹⁰\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e3.5mm headphone jack\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWi-Fi: 2.4GHz | 5GHz¹²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e3 in 2 Hybrid SIM + microSD\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupports NFC¹³\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBluetooth® 5.4\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupports FM radio with headphone jack\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupports AAC / SBC / LDAC\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWi-Fi: 2.4GHz | 5GHz¹²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e3 in 2 Hybrid SIM + microSD\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupports NFC¹³\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBluetooth® 5.1\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupports FM radio with headphone jack\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupports AAC / SBC / LDAC\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimer\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹ Data obtained from the light daily use model of Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary. Charging data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs, actual results may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e² Data obtained from Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary. Product may vary by region, please refer to the actual product.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³ Please consult the local seller on the availability of the power adapter in the box.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁴ Supported up to 22.5W wired reverse charging, compatible with devices verified through Xiaomi Internal Labs testing. Actual performance may vary depending on battery conditions and other factors. When using this feature, please ensure your phone has sufficient battery and verify the compatibility of the receiving device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁵ Refresh rate can be adjusted to up to 120Hz for supported apps.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁶ The device with IP64 has been tested to be resistant to splash and dust in the presence of specific laboratory conditions with the classification IP64 ingress protection based on IEC 60529:1989+A1:1999+A2:2013. Splash-proof, waterproof, and dustproof features may be degraded due to daily use loss. Do not charge your smartphone in humid conditions. The life scene is different from the experimental environment. Do not immerse your smartphone in water completely or expose it to solutions such as seawater and chlorinated water or liquids such as drinks during daily use. Your warranty does not cover the damage caused by man-made immersion of your device in liquid.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁷ Color and availability of all models may vary between markets.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁸ 12GB RAM with Memory extension is based on 6GB RAM version. Additional RAM will occupy a corresponding amount of ROM storage. Memory extension is only available when there is enough storage space on your device. Actual extension of RAM storage capacity varies across different models.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁹ Availability of Xiaomi HyperOS 3 features, apps, and services may vary depending on software version and phone model.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁰ Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs, 300% volume boost refers to 17 levels of volume compared to 15 levels, and actual effects may vary due to software and scenarios, please refer to the actual use.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹¹ microSD card for expandable storage sold separately, please refer to the actual use.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹² Connectivity and network bands may vary based on region availability and local operator support.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹³ NFC availability may vary between markets.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁴ Configurations available may differ between different regions. Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones, smart hardware, and smart electric vehicles connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience, and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In December 2025, the MAU reached 754.1 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform. As of December 31, 2025, the number of IoT devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops, and tablets) reached 1,079.2 million. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merging personal devices, smart home products, and cars. The Company has rapidly emerged as a leading innovator in the smart electric vehicle industry, reaching profitability within six quarters of commencing deliveries and delivering over 600,000 units by February 2026. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2026, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the eighth year in a row, ranking 232nd.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index. Xiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"3727","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1786068244"},"common":null}